ged, area or single-target.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Way</h2>32 skills split between physical and magical. Equipment with damage bonuses and trophies with unique effects. Each hero has an exclusive passive that defines their playstyle. The Blacksmith transmutes your gear to adapt to any strategy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Preparation Room</h2>Between each wave, visit the Merchant to buy equipment and trophies, or the Blacksmith to transmute your items. Gear up before facing the next challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Progression</h2>Ashes collected during runs unlock upgrades at the Altar that persist between matches. The more you play, the stronger your next hero starts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Heroes</h2>Each hero has a unique starting skill, passive and stats — from brutal berserkers to arcane sorceresses. Find the one that fits your style.<br>", "short_description": "Emberlorn is a dark fantasy action roguelike with wave-based combat. Choose your hero, face increasingly dangerous hordes, gear up between waves, and fight your way to survival. Every run is different.", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil, German, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Russian, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4585550/f678a4db88d7eae545c13192cc2ed9a1a711055e/header.jpg?t=1777307785", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4585550/f4769a45b34157225b8792773f5b52f37e8dabb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777307785", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4585550/f4769a45b34157225b8792773f5b52f37e8dabb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777307785", "website": "https://hudsonafie-sudo.github.io/emberlorngame/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<